<title>USA: U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department breakdown of soybean oil exports (tonnes):</p>
<p> -			Feb97    Jan97    Feb96</p>
<p> -	   Crude   83,526   55,931   26,142</p>
<p> -  Once Refined    1,186    2,584    4,081</p>
<p> - Fully Refined   23,404   27,857   13,506</p>
<p> -  Hydrogenated	365	142	274</p>
<p> -	   Total  108,481   86,514   44,003</p>
